    <selectionEntry id="99eb-e6d9-d466-8d5e-4ed8d" name="Kastelan Robot Maniple" page="64" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="19a8-4bb2-43d3-626b-4ed8d" name="Kastelan Battle Protocols" page="65" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Kastelan Robots always begin the battle with Aegis Protocol active. As long as the unit have at least one Cybernetica Datasmith, you can change to a new Battle Protocol at the end of your turn. The new Battle Protocol becomes active at the start of your next turn.

· Conqueror Protocol: Kastelan Robots can't shoot, but have their Attack characteristic doubled.
· Aegis Protocol: Kastelan Robots have Feel No Pain special rule.
· Protector Protocol: Kastelan Robots can't move, run or assault, but fire the carapace-mounted weapon twice.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups />
      <entryLinks>
