    <selectionEntry id="1323-f065-796d-fd19-4ed8d" name="Cohort Cybernetica" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="6ff3-a0eb-7aee-7bf4-4ed8d" name="Adept of the Cybernetica" page="66" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>The Tech-Priest Dominus of this Cohort Cybernetica Formation counts as a Cybernetica Datasmith for the purposes of the Battle Protocols special rule. As long as the Tech-Priest Dominus is alive, the Battle Protocols are activated instantly.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="57c8-6adf-f56d-e488-4ed8d" name="Targeting Override" page="66" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>In the Shooting phase, any number of this Cohort Cybernetica Formation's Cybernetica Datasmiths and/or Tech-Priest Dominus can direct the fire of the Kastelan Robots, instead of shooting. For each model that does so, one Kastelan Robot can shoot at a different target to the rest of the unit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="03c7-dc3a-3d64-4132-4ed8d" name="Cohort Cybernetica" page="66" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>All models in this Formation must be fielded as a single unit, even though this is not normally allowed. The Formation's Tech-Priest Dominus cannot leave this unit.

This Formation counts as three units for the purposes of Canticles of the Omnissiah until it is completely destroyed, and counts as three units for the purposes of Victory Points when it is completely destroyed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups />
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink id="7d51-483c-3239-0188-4ed8d" hidden="false" targetId="99eb-e6d9-d466-8d5e-4ed8d" type="selectionEntry">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="2.0" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="9ac5-612e-cb25-88d7-4ed8d" type="min" />
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="2.0" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="db59-f56c-94ea-8731-4ed8d" type="max" />
          </constraints>
        </entryLink>
        <entryLink id="1655-64c9-fefa-a3c5-4ed8d" name="New EntryLink" hidden="false" targetId="af47-061e-5bed-7396-4ed8d" type="selectionEntryGroup">
